      NGC1052-DF2              f_req = 0.287  ->  Upsilon_V = 0.57 (carried at Upsilon_V = 2 in the source item)
      Pal 4                    f_req = 0.111  ->  Upsilon_V = 0.22 (carried at Upsilon_V = 2 in the source item)
      NGC1052-DF4              f_req = 0.053  ->  Upsilon_V = 0.11 (carried at Upsilon_V = 2 in the source item)
      NGC 2419                 f_req = 0.533  ->  Upsilon_V = 1.07 (carried at Upsilon_V = 2 in the source item)
